# The deployed static client and the AppSail backend are on DIFFERENT Catalyst
# domains — the client domain does not proxy /serverless/* to AppSail (verified:
# it returns 404). So the browser must call the AppSail origin directly.
#
# Committed deliberately: this is a public URL, not a secret, and leaving it
# unset silently baked http://127.0.0.1:9000 into the deployed bundle.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://ksp-intelhub-core-50043016098.development.catalystappsail.in

# DO NOT put NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY here. This file is tracked, and a key
# committed to it is exactly how the previous one became public. Put it in
# web/.env.local, which is gitignored and is read by `next build` all the same.
